#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.store_advanced_indexing.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.store\\_advanced\\_indexing"
msgstr "cuda.tile.store\\_advanced\\_indexing"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store_advanced_indexing:1 of
msgid "Stores a `tile` into non-contiguous slices of `array`."
msgstr "将 ``tile`` 存储到数组的非连续切片中。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store_advanced_indexing:3 of
msgid ""
"Uses the same ``indices`` convention as :func:`load_advanced_indexing` — "
"exactly one entry is a 1-D integer :class:`Tile` (sparse dim) and the "
"rest are :class:`Slice` objects (dense dims). The tile's shape must "
"exactly match the shape implied by the indices."
msgstr ""
"使用与 :func:`load_advanced_indexing` 相同的 ``indices`` 约定——其中必须有且仅有一项为一维整数 "
":class:`Tile` （稀疏维度），其余各项均为 :class:`Slice` 对象（稠密维度）。待存储 Tile "
"的形状必须与索引所指定的形状完全一致。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store_advanced_indexing:8 of
msgid ""
"If the tile lies entirely outside the tiled view, the behavior is "
"undefined."
msgstr "若 Tile 完全位于分块视图之外，则行为未定义。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.store_advanced_indexing.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store_advanced_indexing:10 of
msgid "Array to store into."
msgstr "要写入数据的数组。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store_advanced_indexing:12 of
msgid "Same convention as :func:`load_advanced_indexing`."
msgstr "与 :func:`load_advanced_indexing` 遵循相同约定。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store_advanced_indexing:14 of
msgid "Tile to store. Shape must exactly match the shape implied by ``indices``."
msgstr "要存储的 Tile。其形状必须与 ``indices`` 所指定的形状完全一致。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store_advanced_indexing:17 of
msgid "DRAM traffic hint (1 = low, 10 = high)."
msgstr "DRAM 访存负载强度提示（1 = 低，10 = 高）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store_advanced_indexing:19 of
msgid "If ``False``, TMA will not be used."
msgstr "若为 ``False`` ，则不会使用 TMA。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.store_advanced_indexing:23 of
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

